  "7038968549": "Experienced Physics Educator and Academic Leader with 8+ years of teaching excellence in coaching and competitive exam preparation. Currently serving as Assistant Director at S. Gaikwad Classes, specializing in Physics for NEET, JEE, MHT-CET, and Board examinations. Known for delivering concept-based learning, effective problem-solving techniques, and mentoring students towards academic success.\n\nExperience\n\nAssistant Director – S. Gaikwad Classes\n\nSenior Physics Faculty\n\n8+ Years of Teaching & Academic Leadership Experience\n\nAreas of Expertise\n\nPhysics Teaching (XI & XII Science)\n\nNEET, JEE & MHT-CET Preparation\n\nBoard Exam Coaching\n\nConceptual Learning Methodologies\n\nProblem-Solving & Numerical Techniques\n\nStudent Mentoring & Performance Enhancement\n\nAcademic Planning & Faculty Coordination",
  "7219070001": "I am a dedicated career counsellor specializing in guiding students through diverse academic and professional pathways. With extensive knowledge across Engineering, MBA, BBA, Medical, Law, B.Com, BCA, Pharmacy, B.Sc, Diploma in Engineering, Nursing, Dental, HSC, MCA, Hotel Management, M.Com, and B.A., I support students in making informed decisions that align with their strengths, passions, and long-term goals.\n\nWhether you're exploring higher education options after HSC, aiming for specialized professional programs, or planning advanced studies like MBA/MCA/M.Com, I provide personalized counselling tailored to your unique aspirations. I assist students in understanding course structures, eligibility, career prospects, college selection, entrance preparation, and future opportunities in each domain.\n\nFrom technical fields like engineering and computer applications, to thriving sectors like healthcare, law, business, pharmacy, hospitality, and arts — I ensure you receive the right guidance at every step of your academic journey.\n\nLet’s work together to craft a clear and confident path toward your future success! 🌟",
