  "7276341029": "I’m Shreya, an Engineering Admission and Career Counsellor dedicated to helping students navigate this important phase with clarity and confidence.\nI guide students in selecting the right college and branch across Maharashtra, keeping their rank, interests, and goals in mind.\nI provide step-by-step support during CAP rounds, including detailed cutoff analysis and accurate option filling.\nMy counselling style is simple, honest, and student-friendly, so students feel comfortable asking questions.\nI focus on reducing stress by explaining every option clearly and practically.\nMy aim is to help students make well-informed decisions they feel confident about in the long run.",
  "7292935303": "I am a dedicated engineering counsellor based in Maharashtra, passionate about empowering students to achieve their academic and career goals in the field of engineering. With extensive experience in educational guidance, I specialize in helping students navigate the complex landscape of engineering admissions, entrance exams, college selection, and branch specialization.\n\nMy counselling approach is rooted in a deep understanding of current educational trends, industry requirements, and the unique needs of each student. I provide personalized career planning, support with application processes, and up-to-date information on top engineering colleges across India. My expertise spans JEE Main/Advanced, MH-CET, private university exams, and direct admissions, ensuring that students and parents receive accurate advice for both government and private institutions.\n\nIn addition to academic counselling, I guide students through the selection of suitable engineering streams and help them understand future prospects such as placements, internships, and further studies. I am committed to building confidence in students, clarifying doubts about career options, and helping them make well-informed decisions about their future.\n\nWhether you are a student aspiring to pursue engineering, or a parent seeking clarity on higher education opportunities, I provide reliable support and mentorship at every stage—turning aspirations into realities through effective guidance and genuine care.",
  "7391866727": "Dr. Sandesh Ajay Bhagat\n​Medical Educator & Competitive Exam Specialist\n📍 Shop No 6, Jai Plaza, Dahanu | 📞 7391866727 | ✉️ sandeshbhagat2000@gmail.com\n​Professional Summary\n​Accomplished Medical Educator with 3 years of experience in clinical instruction and entrance exam coaching. Currently associated with KM Paramedical Institute, I specialize in high-stakes academic preparation for medical and engineering aspirants.\n​My expertise spans professional paramedical subjects like Pharmacology and Zoology, as well as rigorous coaching for NEET, MHT-CET, and JEE. I employ a result-oriented teaching methodology, limiting intake to 10 students per month to ensure personalized mentorship, conceptual depth, and intensive practice required for national-level competitive exams.\n​Educational & Coaching Expertise\n​NEET & MHT-CET Specialist: Comrehensive Biology coaching focusing on NCERT mastery, high-weightage topics (Genetics, Human Physiology, Ecology), and MCQ-solving techniques.\n​Paramedical Instruction: Expert teaching in Zoology and Pharmacology, bridging the gap between theory and medical application.\n​Strategic Mentorship: Dedicated focus on small batches to track individual progress and improve exam performance.\n​Current Affiliation & Experience\n​Medical Educator | KM Paramedical Institute Dahanu, Maharashtra * Duration: 3 Years\n​Key Responsibilities: Curriculum development for paramedical students and specialized coaching for competitive exams (NEET/CET).",
  "7415208802": "A dedicated and skilled professional with 2.5 years of experience at LearnerAid, delivering high-quality support and services with a strong commitment to excellence. With a consistent rating of 4, I bring reliability, expertise, and a learner-focused approach to every task.\n\nI operate Monday to Friday, maintaining accessible office hours from 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM. My academic background includes a B.Sc, and I am proficient in both Hindi and English, enabling effective communication with a diverse audience.\n\nBased in Madhya Pradesh, I am committed to providing dependable and efficient assistance, continuously improving my skills, and contributing positively to organizational goals.",
