  "8177842601": "Nikhil Dilip Jain\nCareer Consultant & Academic Counselor\n​With 9 years of experience in the education sector, I specialize in guiding students through the complexities of JEE and NEET entrance exams. Currently associated with Resonance Eduventures Ltd, I provide strategic counseling to help students navigate their academic journey with clarity and confidence.\n​Specialization: JEE & NEET Counseling",
  "8263029775": "I’m a Career Counsellor specializing in Engineering Admissions, guiding students across Maharashtra toward the right colleges and branches based on their aptitude, interests, and exam scores.\n\nWith a strong focus on clarity and practical guidance, I help students understand CAP rounds, cutoff trends, and the entire counselling process, making engineering admissions simple and stress-free.\n\nI also collaborate with Aditya (COEP) to provide authentic and data-driven admission guidance, ensuring students receive real insights from top engineering institutions in Maharashtra.",
  "8265040588": "I’m Piyush, an Engineering Admission Counsellor helping students across Maharashtra make smart and realistic choices for their engineering journey.\nI guide students through college and branch selection, along with CAP rounds, cutoff analysis, and option filling, in a clear and structured way.\nMy focus is on practical guidance and honest insights, so students understand their options without confusion.\nMy goal is to make the admission process simple, transparent, and stress-free for every student.",
  "8308938331": "Dynamic and results-driven education counsellor specializing in MBA admissions, with a strong focus on guiding students from Maharashtra towards top colleges across India. Backed by a year of hands-on experience and having completed my MBA from SCMHRD Pune, I excel at helping aspirants discover, evaluate, and secure admission in management programs that best match their academic goals and career ambitions. My counselling approach combines up-to-date knowledge of entrance exams, college selection, and application processes with personalized support—ensuring students make informed decisions at every step.\n\nWith expertise in the Indian MBA landscape and a thorough understanding of the challenges faced by local students, I provide tailored guidance, from college comparisons to entrance preparation strategy, directly addressing each candidate’s unique needs. Dedicated, approachable, and passionate about student success, I strive to empower my clients to unlock their full potential in India's competitive management education environment.",
  "8369698025": "MAP YOUR CAREER EXPERTISE INVOLVES MBBS NEET AND PG COURSES",
  "8432095801": "As an expert counsellor for engineering in Maharashtra, you play a crucial role in guiding students through their educational and career choices. Your insights can help them navigate the complexities of engineering programs, understand the various specializations available, and make informed decisions about their future.\n\nIn your role, you can provide valuable information on:\n\n1. Engineering Disciplines: Explain the different branches of engineering, such as mechanical, civil, computer, and electrical, and their career prospects.\n\n2. Admission Processes: Offer guidance on entrance exams, application procedures, and important deadlines for various engineering colleges in Maharashtra.\n\n3. Career Opportunities: Discuss potential career paths, industry trends, and the skills required to succeed in the engineering field.\n\n4. Personalized Guidance: Tailor your advice based on individual student interests, strengths, and aspirations, ensuring they find the right fit for their education.\n\n5. Workshops and Seminars: Organize events that provide students with insights from industry professionals, helping them understand real-world applications of their studies.\n\nYour expertise not only empowers students but also contributes to shaping the future of engineering in Maharashtra.",
  "8483854004": "Chemistry (Practical & Organic Chemistry)\nExperience:\n7+ years of teaching experience in coaching classes\nLecturer at Maulana Azad College of Arts, Science and Commerce, Aurangabad\nTaught postgraduate (M.Sc. Chemistry) students from 2017 to 2022\nShort Description About the Counselor:\nI am Shaikh Mussadique Ahmed Mushtaque, currently pursuing a Ph.D. in Organic Chemistry. I specialize in chemistry practicals and advanced-level teaching. From 2017 to 2022, I taught postgraduate (M.Sc. Chemistry) students at Maulana Azad College, Aurangabad.\nI am also the President of Mavin Star Education and Welfare Society, Aurangabad, an organization working in the education and healthcare sectors with 120 volunteers. I have published one patent and three research papers in reputed journals. My aim is to provide quality education and guide students toward academic excellence.",
  "8485841622": "A dedicated and student-centric Education Counsellor with extensive experience guiding learners across India on critical academic and career decisions, including Study Abroad opportunities, choosing the right streams/subjects, and exploring unconventional academic paths that align with future-ready careers. Having completed an MBA from IIM Ahmedabad, this counsellor combines top-tier management education with ground-level counselling expertise to deliver practical, structured, and outcome-focused guidance.\n\nSkilled in helping students and parents navigate complex choices after 10th, 12th, and graduation, the counsellor offers personalised mentoring on subject combinations, course selection, and country/program fit for overseas education. With a strong understanding of evolving global and Indian education trends, they specialise in presenting clear comparisons, demystifying new-age and offbeat careers, and building realistic roadmaps tailored to each student’s aptitude, budget, and long-term goals.\n\nKnown for a calm, approachable style and transparent advice, this counsellor works pan-India and supports students through every step—from clarity on interests and psychometric insights to shortlisting courses, colleges, and unconventional options such as liberal arts, design, communication, and emerging tech-linked programs. The focus is always on helping students make informed, confident decisions that balance passion, practicality, and long-term career growth.",
  "8554998152": "Narendra Deoram Jejurkar Mathematics Educator & Student Counselor I believe that a strong foundation in Mathematics is the gateway to a student’s future success. With 25 years of experience in the field of education, my mission has always been to simplify complex concepts and help students overcome their fear of numbers.  As the founder of Shree Jay Gajanan Classes in Nashik, I specialize in teaching Mathematics for students in SSC & HSC boards. My approach goes beyond the textbook; I act as a counselor and mentor, guiding my students through their academic challenges and helping them build the confidence they need to excel in their board exams and beyond.  How I Can Help Targeted Coaching: Comprehensive math preparation for 10th and 12th standards.  Expert Guidance: 25 years of insights into student psychology and academic performance.  Consistent Support: I am available every day to ensure students stay on track with their goals.  Get In Touch I invite you to visit my center for a consultation to discuss your child’s academic journey.  Address: Shop No. 7, Rajiv Complex, Rajiv Nagar, Nashik.  Office Hours: 12:00 PM to 3:00 PM (Available All Days)",
