  "8767318431": "I’m a Career Counsellor specializing in Engineering Admissions, guiding students across Maharashtra toward the right colleges and branches based on their aptitude, interests, and exam scores. With a strong focus on clarity and practical insights, I help students understand every step of the CAP rounds, cutoff trends, and counselling process — making complex admissions simple and stress-free.\n\nAs a YouTuber, I regularly share informative videos about engineering entrance exams, college reviews, branch comparisons, and admission strategies, helping thousands of students make confident choices about their future.\n\nI also collaborate with Aditya (COEP) to deliver authentic and data-driven admission guidance, ensuring students get real insights from top engineering institutions in Maharashtra.",
